  m_text: 'A simulated radiation alert will begin in one of the ship''s rooms. Read the detector, talk to the Safety Officer, then reach the Radiation Control Room and activate shielding.


    The red warning area is a game visualization, not visible radiation. The detector numbers are simulated game readings. This drill is not real radiation-safety training.'
